{"slug":"snaptrade","name":"SnapTrade","description":"SnapTrade is a unified brokerage connectivity and trading API that enables fintech teams and developers to connect users’ brokerage accounts, access normalized portfolio data (balances, holdings, orders, transactions), and place trades for stocks, ETFs, options, and crypto through a single secure integration. With SDKs, webhooks, and high-success authentication, it powers portfolio tracking, holdings verification, and embedded trading across hundreds of millions of retail investor accounts.","icon":"https://storage.googleapis.com/stuff.thingsofbrand.com/snaptrade.com/images/imgf_snaptrade.png","domain":"snaptrade.com","rank":232,"labels":["Finance","Developer Tools"],"categories":["accounting","developer-tools"],"eventsRead":true,"events":[{"n":"Place Equity Order","d":"Place a buy or sell order for a stock or ETF in a connected brokerage account.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Get Equity Quotes","d":"Retrieve current market quotes for specified equity symbols in a user's account (up to 10 symbols).","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Estimate Equity Order Impact","d":"Estimate the cost, fees, and expected execution impact of placing a stock or ETF buy or sell order in a connected brokerage account.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Place Options Order","d":"Place an options trade in a connected brokerage account by submitting one or more option legs with order type, price, and time in force.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"List Crypto Pairs","d":"List cryptocurrency trading pairs for a user's account, optionally filtering by base or quote currency.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Cancel Order","d":"Cancel an order on a user's brokerage account using the brokerage order ID.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Find Account Symbols","d":"List cryptocurrency trading pairs available in an account, optionally filtering by base or quote currency.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"List Accounts","d":"List brokerage accounts connec